{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-87","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-87-talk-403815861-line","text":"「欢迎来到圣多明戈城！我们倒卖作弊代码。」这位机械招待满不在乎地说，「你小时候一定热衷的那种。但我们这儿的不一样，这里是圣多明戈之城版本。」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-87-talk-403815862-line","text":"「随便你怎么用，只要不被机械警察抓到。」它咯咯地笑了。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-87-talk-403815864-line","text":"你浅尝辄止。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-87-talk-403815866-line","text":"你小心翼翼。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-87-text-8418967634525401750-choice","text":"钱和奇物全要了。","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-87-text-365576060722906078-effect","text":"老赌徒出现了。","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-87-talk-403815868-line","text":"你进行了一场豪赌！谁知道以后会发生什么呢？","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-87-text-10616639495041709094-choice","text":"你不需要。","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-87-text-5063276290943185190-effect","text":"这种游戏不可开启。","speaker":""}]}
